  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC045 (Missing Include) now flags the null-conditional spellings of inline and indexed navigation reads that were silently missed: db.Orders.FirstOrDefault()?.Customer?.Name, FirstOrDefault()?.Customer.Address?.City, FirstOrDefault()?.Customer.Clear(), orders?[0].Customer.Name, and var o = orders?[0]. A dedicated adversarial pass over the conditional-access surface (the code behind the 5.6.0 csc crash) confirmed no remaining crash shapes — deep ?. chains, !/cast mixes, interpolation, and nested conditional access in arguments all terminate cleanly and are locked in by regression tests.",
